  Nicolás Giacobone\n𝗣𝗵𝗼𝘁𝗼𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗵𝗶𝗲 : Em
 manuel Lubezki\n𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 : Warner Bros. Pi
 ctures\, Legendary Pictures\, TC Productions\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿
